        "created_at": "2025-09-24T08:17:16.260Z",
        "cooked": "<p>(Make sure that you have applied a tag while posting. Use the below template while posting your queries in the forum. Both these actions from your end will help the course instructors and peers to address your query more effectively. <strong>You can remove this portion while posting your query</strong>)</p>\n<p>My specific doubt is on the topic:</p>\n<p>My</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Recommended:<br>\nMention what you have done till now to find clarification on the doubt:</p>\n<p>The year in the year to last_birthday in GrPA5 should be 2024 if one takes current year as 2025. But the answer is coming as 2022 last year and 2023 current year. Please clarify if it is correct or 2025 is to be taken as current year.</p>\n<p>Thanks</p>\n<p>RAJESH</p>",
