        "created_at": "2025-09-25T04:27:59.334Z",
        "cooked": "<p>sir,</p>\n<p>i have done this, but changed current year for answer.</p>\n<p>last_birthday = str(int(dob[0:2]))+“/”+str(int(dob[3:5]))+“/”+str(2023-((9,24)&lt;(int(dob[0:2]),int(dob[3:5]))))[-2:]</p>\n<p>logic I used:</p>\n<p>2023 - ( 1 if current date is less than 24.09 ( I did it yesterday)  and 0 if current date is after 24.09)</p>",
